GeoNames geographical database
==============================

`cities15000.tsv` in this directory is derived from the GeoNames
`cities15000` export (all cities with a population greater than 15,000).

    Source:  https://www.geonames.org
    Export:  https://download.geonames.org/export/dump/cities15000.zip
    Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

This work is licensed under CC BY 4.0. The GeoNames data is used here
unmodified in substance; the derivation is a mechanical subset, performed by
`scripts/build_gazetteer.py`:

  - only the name, ASCII name, latitude, longitude, ISO country code and
    population columns are retained;
  - the `alternatenames` column is dropped;
  - rows with a population of zero are dropped;
  - rows are re-sorted by descending population for a stable, diffable asset.

No other transformation is applied. Coordinates and populations are the
GeoNames values.

